infinite-patch 1
# Film events as notes: a Keyboard (the injection point) into a click-short synth into Audio Out.
node 1 Notes Keyboard
  id keys
end
node 2 Synths Wavetable
  id hit
  f a.ampAttack 1
  f a.ampDecay 60
  f a.ampSustain 0
  f a.ampRelease 20
end
node 3 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
end
note hit 0 keys
aud speakers 0 hit
